	(text "Sensor port: 2x4 box header, pin n = Robo-Tank v3 sensor RJ45 pin n\n(pin 1 GND, 2..7 = sensor 6..1, 8 = +5 V); adapter cable to RJ45 wired 1:1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 119.38 0)
		(effects
